#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0288 expect=violation domain=TS
#note "TSVALCD C000000 is not in sdtmct-2024-09-27's Term CCODE set {C49488, C66731} -> fires once, on the CDISC row only; the MEDDRA row is outside the rule (prefix guard). Pins the dataset-level list binding as a membership right-hand side (TSVALCD not in $VALID_TERM_CODES) and not empty($VALID_TERM_CODES) over the function's broadcast list."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#library codelist-attributes sdtmct-2024-09-27 "Term CCODE" C49488 C66731
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt TSVALCD=C000000
dataset TS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col TSSEQ    type=Num
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSVAL    type=Char
col TSVCDREF type=Char
col TSVCDVER type=Char
col TSVALCD  type=Char
---
S1 | TS | 1 | SPECIES | HUMAN        | CDISC  | 2024-09-27 | C000000
S1 | TS | 2 | INDIC   | HYPERTENSION | MEDDRA | 25.0       | 10020772
